1
00:00:00,242 --> 00:00:01,191
Shoshma!

2
00:00:01,221 --> 00:00:03,251
Flamingolar pushti rangda tug‘ilmaydi.

3
00:00:03,251 --> 00:00:04,794
Ular kulrang bo‘lib tug‘iladi!

4
00:00:04,898 --> 00:00:06,903
Unda ularni kim bo‘yagan?

5
00:00:07,105 --> 00:00:08,036
Hech kim.

6
00:00:08,066 --> 00:00:09,345
Ularni o‘z ovqati bo‘yagan!

7
00:00:09,498 --> 00:00:10,939
Mitti krevetkalar va suvo‘tlarda

8
00:00:10,969 --> 00:00:12,876
maxsus pigmentlar bor.

9
00:00:12,895 --> 00:00:13,968
Vaqt o‘tishi bilan

10
00:00:13,998 --> 00:00:16,187
ular flamingolarni asta-sekin pushti rangga bo‘yaydi.

11
00:00:16,448 --> 00:00:18,033
Shuning uchun shunday deymiz:

12
00:00:18,033 --> 00:00:19,935
“Nima yesang, o‘sha bo‘lasan!”

13
00:00:20,496 --> 00:00:22,808
Ya’ni yegan ovqating tanangga ta’sir qiladi.

14
00:00:24,798 --> 00:00:26,307
Xo‘sh... har kuni pushti smuzi ichadigan

15
00:00:26,337 --> 00:00:27,849
o‘sha do‘sting-chi?

16
00:00:27,849 --> 00:00:29,633
Unga ko‘z-quloq bo‘lib tur!
